-- 1. Rate limit: three algorithms, same builder call
token bucket: second call refused with rate.exhausted
fixed window: second call refused with rate.exhausted
sliding window: second call refused with rate.exhausted
-- 2. Bulkhead: at most one operation in flight
inner call refused with concurrency_capacity_exhausted
-- 3. Circuit breaker: count window or time window
call 5 refused with circuit_open; the callable ran 4 times
time-window circuit compiled: choosing
-- 4. Retry-After: a wait too long for the policy is returned to you, not slept through
deferred with retry_after_exceeds_maximum_delay; wait hint present: yes
the throttling exception is kept as previous: yes
next operation deferred with cooldown_exceeds_deadline; the callable ran 1 time(s) in total
-- 5. Fallback: replace failures, and optionally refusals
business_outcomes_only: second call refused with rate.exhausted
include_admission_refusals: second call returned 'cached catalog'
-- 6. Deadline: one budget for the whole operation
late result replaced by deadline_exceeded
